Q: How to convert HTML entities into special characters using plain JavaScript A: <p>You can do it using basic JavaScript or by using the jQuery.</p>
<pre><code>newText = &quot;Übergroße Äpfel mit Würmern&quot;;
var my_unescaped_text = jQuery('&lt;div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;').html(newText).text();
</code></pre>
